    "title": "New Harry Potter Audiobooks Featuring Young British Actors",
    "text": "• Young British actors Frankie Treadaway, Arabella Stanton, and Max Lester are voicing Harry Potter characters for Audible.\n• The audiobook features different actors for each character instead of a single narrator.\n• The actors expressed enjoyment in voice acting and being part of the Harry Potter universe.\n• They mentioned having a snack cupboard and fridge filled with chocolate during recording sessions.\n• The audiobook of 'Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone' is set to release on November 4.",
